      "message": "It is also unfortunate that we need this extra annotation. Note that `new_size` is assigned to `bw-\u003emax_pos` in the next line, so we still satisfy the annotaton in src/utils/bit_writer_utils.h that `buf` is sized by `max_pos`.",
